{"page_id": "parsebench_docs-94ddf5f4_docs_layout_ir2025_all_en_p25-p1", "markdown": "# MUFG Report 2025\n\nManagement Message\n\nMUFG's Corporate Value\n\nStrategies to Improve Corporate Value\n\nFoundation Supporting the Corporate Value\n\n• Data Sectioni\n\n25\n\nMUFG's Corporate Value\n\nTrajectory of MUFG's Corporate Value Enhancement\n\n2005-\n\nStrengthened investment banking operations\n\n2005\n\n- Established the MUFG Way (renamed from Corporate Vision)\n- Launched the Digital Service Business Group, transitioning to a seven-business group structure\n- Announced the MUFG Carbon Neutrality Declaration\n\n• MUFG inaugurated; Mitsubishi UFJ Trust and Banking, Mitsubishi UF\n\nSecurities inaugurated\n\n2012-\n\nEnhanced our presence in the ASEAN region\n\n2013\n\n• Conversion of Bank of Ayudhya (Krungsri), a major commercial bank in I hailand, into a subsidiary\n\nKrunge\n\nHard-earned trust backed by a history spanning more than 360 years and a robust customer base\n\n- Sold MUFG Union Bank\n- Decided investment of approximately\n- 200 billion in digital finance field in Asia\n\n2005\n\nMUFG inaugurated\n\n2006\n\n• Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi UF (now MUFG Bank) inaugurated\n\n2007\n\n• Mitsubishi UFJ NICOS inaugurated\n\n2008\n\n• Strategic alliance with Morgan\n\nStanley\n\nSource: Konoike Limited\n\nPartnership Company\n\n• Capital and operational alliance with Vietnam Joint Stock Commercial Bank for Industry and Trade (VietinBank), a national bank in Vietnam\n\n2015\n\n• Transitioned to aicompany with three committeesiỊistructure\n\n2016\n\n• Capital and business alliance with Security Bank Corporation in the Philippines\n\n2018\n\n• Integrated corporate lending operations of the Bank and Trust Bank\n\n2019\n\n- Conversion of Bank Danamon, Indonesia, into a subsidiary\n- UnionBanCal Corporation became a wholly owned subsidiary of MUFG\n- ACOM became a subsidiary of MUFG (JGAAP only)\n\n- Converted Mitsubishi UFJ Asset Management into a wholly owned subsidiary